    "html": "<p>An object performs simple harmonic motion with amplitude <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"A\"></span>. The table shows the kinetic energy and potential energy of the object at a specific displacement <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"x\"></span> from the equilibrium position.</p>\n<table><thead><tr><th>Energy type</th><th>Value / mJ</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Kinetic energy</td><td>12.0</td></tr><tr><td>Potential energy</td><td>4.0</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>What is the displacement <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"x\"></span> in terms of <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"A\"></span>?</p><ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"0.25 A\"></span></p></li><li data-label=\"B\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"0.50 A\"></span></p></li><li data-label=\"C\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"0.75 A\"></span></p></li><li data-label=\"D\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"0.87 A\"></span></p></li></ol>"
